    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HexaUrbs is a minimalistic city builder where you can place variety of tiles to create beautiful city within minutes without worrying about any kind of resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Types you can place:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Residential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Commercial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Nature/Parks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Industrial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563120/extras/5849abf462d07a533119b464ae54bd83.avif?t=1746312182\" width=800 height=638 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes in this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. <strong>Scoring Mode</strong> - You start with limited tiles and have to strategically place tiles next to each other such that you get maximum scoring points and then get more tiles to place as you reach scoring milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> - You have unlimited tiles to choose from and can place next to each other as per your wish to create your dream city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create beautiful sandy beaches, rivers lakes etc. by placing water tiles next to other tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563120/extras/5a869410390298a0b36ef315e0cba80e.avif?t=1746312182\" width=800 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to reach out to me in case of any feedback or queries. Thanks!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HexaUrbs is a minimalistic city builder where you can place variety of tiles to create beautiful city within minutes without worrying about any kind of resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Types you can place:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. House</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Residential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Commercial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Nature/Parks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Industrial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563120/extras/5849abf462d07a533119b464ae54bd83.avif?t=1746312182\" width=800 height=638 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two modes in this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. <strong>Scoring Mode</strong> - You start with limited tiles and have to strategically place tiles next to each other such that you get maximum scoring points and then get more tiles to place as you reach scoring milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> - You have unlimited tiles to choose from and can place next to each other as per your wish to create your dream city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create beautiful sandy beaches, rivers lakes etc. by placing water tiles next to other tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563120/extras/5a869410390298a0b36ef315e0cba80e.avif?t=1746312182\" width=800 height=648 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please feel free to reach out to me in case of any feedback or queries. Thanks!</p>",
